7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m checking in-house developer availability and network coverage at customer plants. We keep promising dates based on assumptions that don’t hold up.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the capital budget and software allowance. I also want to review vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
